    2. Choose N=2-4 objects. For each, pick a distinct color from {1-6,9}.
    3. Partition columns 0-7 into N non-overlapping spans with >=1 gap between each.
    4. For each object, pick area and generate a random 4-connected shape fitting
       within its column span and height<=3. Verify area <= 6 and area + top_row_of_shape <= h-2
