> - 对象类：精灵体/sprite, 色彩指引块/color_guide, 象限/quadrant, 分隔栅格/divider_grid, 目录模板/catalog_template, 工作区精灵/workspace_sprite, 目录区域/catalog_region, 矩形对象/rectangle_object, 间隙区域/gap_region, 整幅画布/full_canvas, 前景掩膜/foreground_mask, 分隔行/separator_row, 掩码/mask, 对称图案/symmetric_pattern, 坐标表/coordinate_table, 孔洞/hole, 干扰体/distractor, 晶格网格/lattice_grid, 标记块/marker_block, 固定标记/fixed_marker, 前景对象/foreground_object, 网格边界/grid_boundary, 标记条/marker_bar, 车道/lane, 三角精灵体/triangle_sprite, 全宽条纹/full_width_stripe, 分隔列/separator_column, 等宽面板/equal_width_panel, 标记像素/marker_pixel, 轨迹路径/trace_path, 多米诺骨牌/domino, 边墙/edge_wall, 十字引导线/crosshair_guide_line, 端点像素/endpoint_pixel, 障碍像素/blocker_pixel, 最短路径/shortest_path, 多色对象/multicolor_obj, 侧边标记/side_marker, 面板区域/panel_region
